Thespliterator()method returns aSpliteratorfor the list.

A spliterator is a special type of iterator. To learn how to use iterators, see ourJava Iterator tutorial.

TheSpliteratoris considerably different from an ordinary iterator. The purpose of a spliterator is to separate a collection into smaller pieces so that each piece can be processed by a separate thread. TheSpliteratorinterface has two important methods:

